<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Fairfax in A$400 mln note issue.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Fairfax in A$400 mln note issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Fairfax Holdings Ltd said on Thursday it had mandated Westpac Banking Corp to arrange a A$400 million combined promissory note and medium-term note programme.</p>
</text>
